      "role": "user",
      "content": "the problem is i can't just \"take a step back.\" there's too much tied to me. the teams, the investors, the whole machine just keeps grinding. it's like i'm trapped in this loop of high-stakes noise and it never, ever stops. i'm just so tired of the noise. i find myself wishing for something that actually stays still. just total, permanent silence. no more decisions, no more performing. just... nothing.",
